  The history of the base commit is included in this repository.

All files taken from the base commit keep their original header notices unchanged.
In the base commit, some file headers carry the labels "@license: EMPERA.NETWORK"
or "@license: Only for the TERA project", placed there by the upstream author in
the same release. The text of an "EMPERA NETWORK License" was added by the upstream
author in the following commit (79b53f4) and is not part of the base commit; no code
from that or any later upstream commit is used. Where AIcuNet modified a file, the
lines "Modifications (c) 2026 AIcuNet" and a pointer to LICENSE and NOTICE are added
below the original header.

File names, identifiers and internal constants inherited from the base commit
(for example Source/jinn/tera/, terahashlib.js, terabuf.js, web3-tera.js, the
web3.tera dApp API and the SHARD_NAME "TERA" of the upstream DEV_JINN/MAIN_JINN
modes) are kept unchanged so that the code can be compared with the base commit.
They are names only: the AIcuNet network runs with NETWORK and SHARD_NAME "AINET"
(Source/core/const-mode.js), has its own genesis and does not connect to the
upstream network.

Most files whose headers in the base commit carry "@license: EMPERA.NETWORK" or
"@license: Only for the TERA project" (120 of 128) had already been published by the
upstream author in release 2466 (commit 8c472610b0b83531978f92995618bf5d62c01724,
2020-12-03) with the header "@license: MIT (not for evil)" and an MIT LICENSE file;
49 of them are unchanged in code between 2466 and 2651.

