Main changes by AIcuNet:
- Network AINET, coin Axinit (AXNT), new genesis state (one genesis account name
  keeps the earlier ticker "AICU"; it is part of the chain state).
- Blocks are produced in fixed 3-second time slots.
- Block reward and its distribution between the miner, a development fund
  and a development account.
- Remote auto-update disabled; UPnP off by default; the node HTTP API listens
  on localhost only.
- New wallet interface (Source/HTML/aicunet-wallet.html) with safety checks for
  account creation, key change and transfers.

